The drawing engine and original plugin are upstream work by eznas. This
repository preserves that ancestry and credits the original author.

Notice of modification:
2026-10-04: translated comments; removed the Chinese UI dictionary, language
selection, and Chinese README; added Kobo stylus integration, pressure-aware
strokes, finger-drawing controls, and a PNG export-folder setting; removed
the deprecated metadata name field.
2026-10-11: revised fork documentation, installation guidance, compatibility
claims, provenance, and testing/release guidance; corrected the inherited
brush-tip menu regression assertion to match the seven-button menu and
outside-tap dismissal introduced upstream in v62t.

The kobo-stylus branch is the modified fork. The v63 tag identifies the
upstream base, not a separately validated fork release.

Two bundled icons, drawingpad/icons/appbar.menu.svg and
drawingpad/icons/cre.render.reload.svg, are from the official KOReader icon
set (AGPL-3.0), as acknowledged by upstream. Other bundled icons and demo
assets are retained from upstream. This notice adds no new license grant
for third-party material and does not replace LICENSE.
